      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><button class=\"ds-photo\" aria-label=\"Open Adjustable metal desk lamp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 7h14l2 14H3L5 7Zm3 0V5a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2\"/></svg><span>A good find, photo coming later.</span></button><p class=\"ds-meta\">Room essentials · Local listing</p><div class=\"ds-title-row\"><button class=\"ds-title\">Adjustable metal desk lamp</button><strong class=\"ds-price\">₹550</strong></div><div class=\"ds-seller\"><span class=\"ds-avatar\">DA</span><span>Dev Arora<small>MBA · 2027</small></span><span class=\"ds-pickup\">Pick up: North Campus</span></div></article>",
